{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36871","headline":"中元甲子以辛丑驾幸蜀四首 三 · 罗隐","name":"中元甲子以辛丑驾幸蜀四首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"邪气奔屯瑞气移，清平过尽到艰危。\n纵饶犬彘迷常理，不奈豺狼幸此时。\n九庙有灵思李令，三川悲忆恨张仪。\n可怜一曲还京乐，重对红蕉教蜀儿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36871.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36871","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}